1. What you may do. With a valid licence key you may install and run the
software for your own games, on your own machines or hosting, for as long as
your subscription runs or, with a lifetime licence, for as long as you like.
A trial key gives the same rights for the trial period. Your players may use
the software at your table under your licence. Your games may be paid games:
you may charge your players for a seat, a session or a campaign, and stream
or record your games. What you sell is the game. A licence key covers one
Foundry VTT server that you open to your players. To run several at the same
time, buy a licence for each.

