Union: Directive 2009/24/EC, Articles 5(1), 5(3) and 6, and their national
transpositions). You may not use the software, any part of it, or anything
derived from it as the basis, reference or blueprint for a product that
competes with it, whether yourself or by giving it to an AI system, or to
anyone acting for you, as training data or context. Products compete when
they provide the same or substantially similar functionality, on any
platform, through any interface, in any language, whether sold or given
away. Using the software to run your own games, paid or free, with your
